$y'=-2e^x$, whereas $-2y=4e^x$, so it fails.\n- III: $y=2e^{-x}+1$ gives $y'=-2e^{-x}$, whereas $-2y=-4e^{-x}-2$, so it fails.\n\nSelect **I only**."}]}
